  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India E-Mobility Financing Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme aims to leverage GCF and commercial investor capital to accelerate the decarbonisation of the Indian economy by focusing on electrification of India&#x2019;s transport
sector.

&#x2022; It is the first GCF dedicated purely private sector transport programme in the e-mobility sector as it marks the diversification of GCF funding to underrepresented result areas, targets pioneering investments in the transportation sector.
&#x2022; With the comfort of the junior position of GCF equity, the programme aims to mobilize foreign institutional equity capital to seed an exclusive EV financing and leasing platform, the first of its kind in India.
&#x2022; This platform is expected to be a pioneering institution providing dedicated financing and leasing solutions for EVs at scale that are not being provided by any other financier in the Indian market.</narrative>
  </description>
